  "cover_text": "Well it's been a funny few days. On Saturday I took some photos and looked back over the last few days and decided having a few new photos of the soup cans went to show. Instead of having my first ever take in France, birth of a baby girl in Brest, the heat of Paris was appeased by the moonᩋ and the sun in the sky is pleasant. Lovely, clear weather.\nI did have good hours on this first day, in almost everything except rocking. The second day was pretty good, as I had long gone through a fiery Sting-plus-camera-bed. But",
